    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Working on Putting Make-a-Wish Quest Back in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Blizzard trabaja para volver a poner en marcha Make-a-Wish Quest en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Working on Putting Make-a-Wish Quest Back in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Blizzard está trabajando en volver a poner en marcha Make-a-Wish Quest en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abb020ac37ab3.12053984\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Ezra Chatterton created an iconic World of Warcraft quest as part of a Make-A-Wish request - and now, Blizzard is working on getting his questline implemented in WoW: Forever!<br><br>For those who don't know, in The Burning Crusade, Ezra Chatterton (also known as Ephoenix) was granted a wish through the Make-A-Wish program to design a World of Warcraft quest. That quest became <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/quest=11129/kyles-gone-missing\"><img alt=\"Kyle's Gone Missing!\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-horde\">Kyle's Gone Missing!</span></a>, a small but impactful quest in Mulgore to help <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/npc=23618/ahab-wheathoof\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ahab Wheathoof</span></a> feed his dog, <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/npc=23616/kyle-the-frenzied\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Kyle the Frenzied</span></a>. Not only were Ezra's efforts immortalized in this quest, but his voice was too - Ezra recorded the voice lines for <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/npc=23618/ahab-wheathoof\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ahab Wheathoof</span></a>, leading to one of the most iconic quests Horde players experienced.<br><br>Because this quest was created in TBC, though, it was conspicuously missing from WoW: Forever - and players asked repeatedly across social media for Ezra's tribute to be added to this version of the game. Blizzard has taken notice, and it sounds like Kyle and his faithful Tauren will be added in to WoW: Forever!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2356115/31\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units first\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2356115/22\" target=\"_blank\">Taharken</a><span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-header-link\" href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2356115/22\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">I do hope they make the exception for the time frame and put him in.</div></div>We’re working on it.<br><br>Stay tuned!</div></div>An incredible tribute to an incredible child, Ahab and Kyle will once more be able to help fledgling Tauren on their journey to Thunder Bluff. There are dozens of other tributes scattered throughout Azeroth, and given that Forever is meant to be, well, forever, it would be wonderful to see other in-game tributes eventually added as well.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Ezra Chatterton created an iconic World of Warcraft quest as part of a Make-A-Wish request - and now, Blizzard is working on getting his questline implemented in WoW: Forever!<br /><br />For those who don't know, in The Burning Crusade, Ezra Chatterton (also known as Ephoenix) was granted a wish through the Make-A-Wish program to design a World of Warcraft quest. That quest became <a href=\"/forever/quest=11129/kyles-gone-missing\">Kyle's Gone Missing!</a>, a small but impactful quest in Mulgore to help <a href=\"/forever/npc=23618/ahab-wheathoof\">Ahab Wheathoof</a> feed his dog, <a href=\"/forever/npc=23616/kyle-the-frenzied\">Kyle the Frenzied</a>. Not only were Ezra's efforts immortalized in this quest, but his voice was too - Ezra recorded the voice lines for <a href=\"/forever/npc=23618/ahab-wheathoof\">Ahab Wheathoof</a>, leading to one of the most iconic quests Horde players experienced.<br /><br />Because this quest was created in TBC, though, it was conspicuously missing from WoW: Forever - and players asked repeatedly across social media for Ezra's tribute to be added to this version of the game. Blizzard has taken notice, and it sounds like Kyle and his faithful Tauren will be added in to WoW: Forever!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br />I do hope they make the exception for the time frame and put him in.<br /></div></div><br />We’re working on it.<br /><br />Stay tuned!<br /><br />An incredible tribute to an incredible child, Ahab and Kyle will once more be able to help fledgling Tauren on their journey to Thunder Bluff. There are dozens of other tributes scattered throughout Azeroth, and given that Forever is meant to be, well, forever, it would be wonderful to see other in-game tributes eventually added as well.</noscript>            \n        ",
