      "en": "Cat Form Druid Quest Bug Should Be Resolved",
      "es": "El error de búsqueda de Druidaa del formulario CAT debe resolverse"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Cat Form Druid Quest Bug Should Be Resolved...",
      "es": "El error de búsqueda de Druidaa de la forma de gato debe resolverse..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abaffc859b690.41740139\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Josh Greenfield tweeted out that the bug with the Cat Form Druid quest should be now be resolved. <br><br>The cat form quest for Druids (<a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98404/the-great-windborne-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Windborne Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">The Great Windborne Cat Spirit</span></a>, <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98396/the-great-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-alliance\">The Great Cat Spirit</span></a> and <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98342/the-great-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-horde\">The Great Cat Spirit</span></a>) was bugged, which <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/players-struggling-to-complete-druid-cat-form-quest-in-forever-due-to-quest-383152\" data-contiguous=\"true\">created a large bottleneck</a> for players trying to unlock the iconic cat form. According to Josh Greenfield on Twitter, this has now been fixed. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2104682294397329649\">Tweet #2104682294397329649</a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Josh Greenfield tweeted out that the bug with the Cat Form Druid quest should be now be resolved. <br /><br />The cat form quest for Druids (<a href=\"/forever/quest=98404/the-great-windborne-cat-spirit\">The Great Windborne Cat Spirit</a>, <a href=\"/forever/quest=98396/the-great-cat-spirit\">The Great Cat Spirit</a> and <a href=\"/forever/quest=98342/the-great-cat-spirit\">The Great Cat Spirit</a>) was bugged, which <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/players-struggling-to-complete-druid-cat-form-quest-in-forever-due-to-quest-383152\">created a large bottleneck</a> for players trying to unlock the iconic cat form. According to Josh Greenfield on Twitter, this has now been fixed. <br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
