  {
    "id": "wh-383154",
    "source": "wowhead",
    "dateRaw": "Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:28:43 -0500",
    "author": "Wowhead Staff",
    "category": "Live",
    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Josh Greenfield Teases BRD-Like Mega Dungeon for WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Josh Greenfield se burla de BRD-Like Mega Mazmorra para WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Josh Greenfield Teases BRD-Like Mega Dungeon for WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Josh Greenfield se burla de BRD-Like Mega Mazmorra para WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abb00cce4a017.36876456\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Josh Greenfield has teased a BRD-like Mega Dungeon for WoW: Forever.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">WoW: Forever Dungeons Overview</span></a></div><br><br>Over the weekend, Josh Greenfield (aka Aggrend) replied to a social media message about a BRD-like Mega Dungeon. He responded with:<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2104356489427394592\">Tweet #2104356489427394592</a></div></div><br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Josh Greenfield<span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">\"a good BRD-like mega dungeon\"<br><br>Hold our beer(s).<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304003.jpg\" id=\"1304003\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304003.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Josh Greenfield Teaser\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.72276 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><br>This seems to imply that one of the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details\" data-contiguous=\"true\">new Forever dungeons</a> is going to be another mega dungeon similar to Blackrock Depths. Given that Blackrock Depths is a level 52 to 60 dungeon, plus the \"spoiler-y\" picture included with the tweet, one of the two end-game dungeons is probably another mega dungeon: Blackmaw Hold. <br><br>The original Blackrock Depths has ~20 encounters, taking multiple hours to clear, and another mega-dungeon in the end-game of WoW: Forever will definitely add a lot of new content and rewards for players!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Josh Greenfield has teased a BRD-like Mega Dungeon for WoW: Forever.<br /><br />WoW: Forever Dungeons Overview<br /><br />Over the weekend, Josh Greenfield (aka Aggrend) replied to a social media message about a BRD-like Mega Dungeon. He responded with:<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Josh Greenfield</h2>&quot;a good BRD-like mega dungeon&quot;<br /><br />Hold our beer(s).<br /><br /> </div><br />This seems to imply that one of the new Forever dungeons is going to be another mega dungeon similar to Blackrock Depths. Given that Blackrock Depths is a level 52 to 60 dungeon, plus the &quot;spoiler-y&quot; picture included with the tweet, one of the two end-game dungeons is probably another mega dungeon: Blackmaw Hold. <br /><br />The original Blackrock Depths has ~20 encounters, taking multiple hours to clear, and another mega-dungeon in the end-game of WoW: Forever will definitely add a lot of new content and rewards for players!</noscript>            \n        ",
