      "en": "Players Struggling to Complete Druid Cat Form Quest in Forever Due to Quest Design",
      "es": "Jugadores que luchan por completar la misión de forma de gato Druidaa para siempre debido al diseño de la misión"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Players Struggling to Complete Druid Cat Form Quest in Forever Due to Quest Design...",
      "es": "Jugadores que luchan por completar la misión de forma de gato Druidaa para siempre debido al diseño de la misión..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abb01968e4217.74252708\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">At level 20, Druids can unlock their Cat Form through a quest, but one of the quest objectives is very difficult, if not impossible, to obtain right now.<br><br><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" data-align=\"centered\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnBasis: 800px;\"><div class=\"last\" style=\"border:2px solid red; padding:10px;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><b>This should now be <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/cat-form-druid-quest-bug-should-be-resolved-383157\" data-contiguous=\"true\">resolved</a>.</b></div></div></div><br><br>While Druids can unlock their Bear Form at level 10, Cat Form requires Level 20 to unlock. Each race has a slightly different quest in WoW: Forever (<a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98396/the-great-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-alliance\">The Great Cat Spirit</span></a>, <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98342/the-great-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-horde\">The Great Cat Spirit</span></a>, <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98404/the-great-windborne-cat-spirit\"><img alt=\"The Great Windborne Cat Spirit\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">The Great Windborne Cat Spirit</span></a>), but the quest objectives are the same: players are tasked with collecting three relics from the Stormrage Barrow Den. The Relics are currently a massive bottleneck to completing the quest, as they appear to be bugged. Players who try to loot this get a \"no loot\" error message, and players suspect that the quest items are only lootable if one person clicks on the statues at a time.<div class=\"reddit-markup exclude-units\"><div class=\"reddit-markup-container\" style=\"width: 740px; max-width: 100%;\"><blockquote class=\"reddit-card\" data-embed-theme=\"dark\"><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/classicwow/comments/1ws9wce/druid_cat_form_quest_griefed_noone_has_completed/?share_id=k-TJ5fzSxX75YpbDdAA2k\">Visit Reddit</a></blockquote></div></div><br><br>If you head to this area, you will find many druids waiting in line for a quest that may not be able to be completed. Players have reported that there are griefers who are spam-clicking the lootable item to prevent others from completing it. This issue has been reported on Reddit and multiple times on <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/druid-cat-form-quest-is-bugged-and-held-hostage-by-griefers/2364910\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">the official forums</a>.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>At level 20, Druids can unlock their Cat Form through a quest, but one of the quest objectives is very difficult, if not impossible, to obtain right now.<br /><br /> <b>This should now be <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/cat-form-druid-quest-bug-should-be-resolved-383157\">resolved</a>.</b> <br /><br />While Druids can unlock their Bear Form at level 10, Cat Form requires Level 20 to unlock. Each race has a slightly different quest in WoW: Forever (<a href=\"/forever/quest=98396/the-great-cat-spirit\">The Great Cat Spirit</a>, <a href=\"/forever/quest=98342/the-great-cat-spirit\">The Great Cat Spirit</a>, <a href=\"/forever/quest=98404/the-great-windborne-cat-spirit\">The Great Windborne Cat Spirit</a>), but the quest objectives are the same: players are tasked with collecting three relics from the Stormrage Barrow Den. The Relics are currently a massive bottleneck to completing the quest, as they appear to be bugged. Players who try to loot this get a &quot;no loot&quot; error message, and players suspect that the quest items are only lootable if one person clicks on the statues at a time. <br /><br />If you head to this area, you will find many druids waiting in line for a quest that may not be able to be completed. Players have reported that there are griefers who are spam-clicking the lootable item to prevent others from completing it. This issue has been reported on Reddit and multiple times on <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/druid-cat-form-quest-is-bugged-and-held-hostage-by-griefers/2364910\" rel=\"nofollow\">the official forums</a>.</noscript>            \n        ",
