"https://gear.blizzard.com/collections/world-of-warcraft-grassy-dunecloth-transmog?sort_by=price-ascending\" rel=\"nofollow\">this filter</a>. If you want the transmog, the cheapest item appears to be $30 USD. <br /><br />The three transmog items are: <a href=\"/item=262859/grassy-dunecloth-vest\">Grassy Dunecloth Vest</a>, <a href=\"/item=262840/grassy-dunecloth-belt\">Grassy Dunecloth Belt</a>, and <a href=\"/item=262822/grassy-dunecloth-skirt\">Grassy Dunecloth Skirt</a><br /><br /><i>As part of the Blizzard Gear Store affiliate program, a small portion of sales using the above links will go to supporting Wowhead, at no additional cost to you.</i></noscript>            \n        ",
